# Testing

- E2E tests live only under `e2e/` (outside `src/`). Use Playwright (`@playwright/test`) with Chromium and `*.spec.ts` names. Run with `pnpm test:e2e`.
- Unit tests live next to the covered file in a `tests/` folder, e.g. `src/modules/auth/schema.ts` → `src/modules/auth/tests/schema.test.ts`. Use Vitest Browser Mode (`pnpm test`). Pattern: `src/**/tests/**/*.test.ts(x)`.
- Do not put Playwright specs in `src/`. Do not use a root `tests/` tree or sibling `src/foo.test.ts` files.

```
src/modules/auth/schema.ts          # entity
src/modules/auth/tests/schema.test.ts  # unit (Vitest)

e2e/sign-in.spec.ts             # e2e (Playwright)
```
